{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The fifth time</b><br>בסנסניו (on its branches): the upper branches where there is fruit, and it has no equal." "<b>The second time</b><br>בסנסניו (on its branches): these are the breasts." "She said: I am my beloved's, and upon me is to fulfill his desire." "<b>The third time</b><br>She says, the Shekhinah: then I will come in the company of the righteous." "והיו נא שדיך (and let your breasts be): then they will fulfill all the commandments." "וריח אפך (and the scent of your breath): then a high priest will minister to me."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:55.683165678Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}